"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, Raft Mod Loader will be installed into the Raft core files, along with the required mods, which will be placed in Raft\\mods.\nIf you have launch after setup toggle on, it will boot-up 'RMLLauncher.exe', all you'll need to do, is click 'Play' to launch the game with mods loaded.",
